540
00:35:54,350 --> 00:35:56,350
[COLETTE]
Unbelievable.
ບໍ່ເຊື່ອໄດ້.

541
00:35:56,850 --> 00:36:01,400
[HANNAH]
Coffee? Oh, God. I don't know, Richard. I really appreciate the invitation, but--
